.***START OF SPECIFICATIONS*******************************************  00410007
.*                                                                   *  00410008
.* MODULE NAME - SGAP                                                *  00410009
.*                                                                   *  00410010
.* DESCRIPTIVE NAME - PROCESS THE ALTERNATE POWER (AP) SPECIFCATION  *  00450064
.*                                                                   *  00500064
.* COPYRIGHT - NONE                                                  *  00550064
.*                                                                   *  00600064
.* STATUS - CHANGE LEVEL 00                                          *  00650064
.*                                                                   *  00700064
.* FUNCTION -                                                        *  00750064
.*   THE FUNCTION OF THIS MACRO IS TO INTERPRET THE AP SPECIFICATION *  00800064
