.*                                                                   *  01050064
.* MODULE TYPE - MACRO                                               *  01100064
.*                                                                   *  01150064
.*                                                                   *  01200064
.* INPUT - THE FOLLOWING GLOBALS ARE REFERENCE/SET:                  *  01250064
.*                                                                   *  01300064
.*       &ID      - THE GENERATED OR USER SPECIFIED ID FOR           *  01350064
.*                  MNOTES                                           *  01400064
.*                                                                   *  01500064
.*       &SGCNTRA(3) - DEVICE POINTER                                *  01550064
.*                                                                   *  01600064
.*       &SGAPPMC - AP SPECIFICATION FROM THE IODEVICE MACRO         *  01650064
.*                                                                   *  01700064
.*       &UNIT -    UNIT BEING SPECIFIED                             *  01750064
.*                                                                   *  02100064
